### 健康检查
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### 获取监控任务
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/tasks

### 异步启动一轮 Agent
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/agent-runs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "task_id": 1
}

### 获取最近热点
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/hotspots?limit=10

### 同步执行（调试用）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/agent-runs/sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "task_id": 1
}

